            "review_title": "Review at Citronella Tam Coc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "philippe d\nBruges, Belgium35 contributions\n0\nMust do\nApr 2024 • Couples\nPure gastronomy in an incredibly beautiful environment. Friendly service and to our great surprise we were even addressed in Dutch by 1 staff member?!\nShow original\nWritten April 7, 2024\nTam Coc Garden Resort\nDear esteemed guest, \n\nThank you for this fantastic review! We are glad that you had an amazing experience with our service, from the delicious food to the nature-surrounded location and the welcoming staff. Your visit and dining decision at our restaurant are of great value to us and we will work hard to deliver the high standard and quality to our guests.\n\nWe hope to have the pleasure of welcoming you back. \n\nBest regards, \nCitronella Restaurant - Tam Coc Garden Resort.\nRead more\nWritten April 9, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
